This tree replaces ovos-installer as the source of truth for clinton@mycroft-prime.lan.

Do not run:
  sudo sh -c "$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenVoiceOS/ovos-installer/main/installer.sh)"
  ~/ovos-installer/install.sh
  ansible-playbook ... ovos-installer

Those overwrite mycroft.conf, systemd units, /opt/sj201, and the venv.